# AI Assistant Rules

You are assisting with the AILaga Flutter Project.

Read `docs/AI_AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md` before starting work.
Refer to `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md` for technical context.

When working on UI:
- Use the predefined palette and `google_fonts` (Inter) from `lib/app/theme.dart`.
- Maintain accessibility: large touch targets (>= 48dp), high contrast.
- Ensure the SOS button uses the distinct red without dominating the UI.

When working on Data:
- Check `docs/DEVELOPER_A_TASKS.md` for requirements.
- Never claim successful message delivery unless verified.
- Ensure data is kept strictly offline.
